Three weeks, one BioManager feature a day. Thank you to everyone who tried it.

It stays free and open source. What should it do next? In the app, Feedback (under Help) sends a problem or idea to your lab's admins, and on to us if you choose.

{site}

posts.linkedin:
Three weeks ago I released BioManager and posted one feature a day. Thank you to everyone who downloaded it, set it up for their lab, or sent feedback.

It stays free and open source. What comes next depends on what labs ask for: in the app, Feedback (under Help) keeps a problem or idea for your lab's admins, and Open as a GitHub issue sends it to us if you choose.

{site}

